---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Artikel & Tips Perawatan — Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun: Blog Kecantikan"
  description="Kumpulan artikel edukasi kecantikan, tips perawatan rambut setelah smoothing, panduan nail art tahan lama, dan rahasia lash lift alami dari stylist Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun."
  activePage="artikel"
>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- HERO ARTIKEL -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 pt-8 sm:pt-12 pb-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] font-bold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">
        EDUKASI &amp; JURNAL KECANTIKAN
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#141414] mb-3">
        Artikel &amp; Tips Perawatan Sonae
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#444444] leading-relaxed">
        Panduan praktis langsung dari para terapis dan master stylist Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun untuk menjaga kilau rambut, kekuatan kuku, dan kelentikan bulu mata Anda di rumah.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- FEATURED ARTICLE (BORDERLESS) -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-6">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 group">
      
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 aspect-[16/10] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm shrink-0">
        <img 
          src="/images/headline_models.webp" 
          alt="Panduan Merawat Rambut Setelah Korean Smoothing Sonae Studio" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-95"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-start justify-center">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] font-bold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider">
            FEATURED GUIDE
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#888888]">• 5 Menit Baca</span>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#141414] mb-3 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#7F513C] transition-colors">
          Panduan Lengkap Merawat Rambut Setelah Korean Smoothing Agar Berkilau Tahan 6 Bulan
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#555555] leading-relaxed mb-6 text-justify">
          Setelah melakukan perawatan Korean Silk Smoothing di salon, perawatan harian di rumah memegang peranan penting. Ketahui pantangan 72 jam pertama, pemilihan sampo bebas sulfat, hingga cara blow dry yang benar agar helai rambut tetap lurus jatuh alami tanpa patah.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="/booking" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#BFAF86] text-[#141414] font-bold text-xs hover:brightness-95 shadow-sm transition-all">
            Konsultasi Smoothing
          </a>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#777777] font-medium">Oleh Tim Stylist Sonae</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- ARTICLES GRID (BORDERLESS) -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7F513C] block mb-1">PILIHAN ARTIKEL</span>
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#141414]">Tips Terkini Seputar Kecantikan</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Article 1 -->
      <article class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-5 bg-[#F4EFEA]">
            <img 
              src="/images/expert_stylists.webp" 
              alt="Perbedaan Lash Lift vs Eyelash Extension" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-95"
            />
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#7F513C] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">LASH &amp; BROW</span>
          <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#7F513C] transition-colors">
            Lash Lift vs Eyelash Extension: Mana yang Lebih Pas untuk Gaya Hidupmu?
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Ulasan perbandingan mendalam antara melentikkan bulu mata asli dengan keratin serum versus menyambung helai bulu mata buatan.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#777777]">
          <span>4 Menit Baca</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#7F513C]">Tips Salon</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Article 2 -->
      <article class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-5 bg-[#F4EFEA]">
            <img 
              src="/images/affordable_care.webp" 
              alt="Tips Merawat Japanese Gel Nail Art Tahan Lama" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-95"
            />
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#7F513C] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">NAIL CARE</span>
          <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#7F513C] transition-colors">
            5 Kebiasaan Sederhana Agar Japanese Gel Nail Art Bertahan Lebih dari 4 Minggu
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Hindari mengelupas cat gel secara paksa. Simak tips menjaga kelembapan kutikula dengan vitamin oil agar kuku tetap sehat dan kuat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#777777]">
          <span>3 Menit Baca</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#7F513C]">Kuku Sehat</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Article 3 -->
      <article class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-5 bg-[#F4EFEA]">
            <img 
              src="/images/ladies_room.webp" 
              alt="Perawatan Kulit Kepala untuk Wanita Berhijab" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-95"
            />
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#7F513C] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">HIJAB CARE</span>
          <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#7F513C] transition-colors">
            Mengatasi Masalah Rambut Lepek dan Ketombe Akibat Seharian Berhijab
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Keringat dan kelembapan di balik inner hijab bisa memicu ketombe. Eksfoliasi kulit kepala rutin dengan Scalp Spa jadi solusi terbaiknya.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#777777]">
          <span>5 Menit Baca</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-[#7F513C]">Ladies Room</span>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- CTA BANNER KONSULTASI -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-10">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#BFAF86] p-8 sm:p-12 text-center flex flex-col items-center shadow-soft-card">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#141414] mb-3">
        Punya Pertanyaan Seputar Kondisi Rambutmu?
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2E2E2E] max-w-xl mb-6">
        Jangan ragu untuk berdiskusi dengan tim terapis Sonae Beauty Studio. Konsultasi helai rambut dan rekomendasi perawatan selalu gratis.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/booking" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#141414] text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-neutral-800 shadow-sm transition-all">
          Buat Janji Perawatan
        </a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-[#141414] font-bold text-xs hover:bg-neutral-50 shadow-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#25D366] text-[18px]">chat</span>
          <span>Tanya Stylist via WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
